setting.
When an element is hidden
, it is replaced by a placeholder
labeled as "Hidden" in the replay, and its subviews are not
recorded.
Note: Marking a view as hidden
does not
prevent touch interactions from being recorded on that element. To hide
touch interactions as well, use the
touch override in addition to marking the
element as hidden.
Use setSessionReplayHidden(hide = true)
to hide the
element. Setting hide
to false
removes the
override.
